  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2404b5e0d77914e47b42a02b94434b89, type: 3}
  m_Name: RetailWorkerSuzanne
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  line:
  - Nice to see a new face once in a while...
  - 'I''m Suzanne. You don''t have to tell me your name. '
  - I won't remember it anyway...
  - The place you bought is such an eyesore I hope you buldoze the place.
  - That is the only solution.
  - Talking about eyesores, you should really visit my store.
  - Those overall's are not it!
  - See you later.
  actor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 47afbc69deb10e147aafc8675b1f210b, type: 2}
